// LSASS Opened With Memory Read Rights
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_lsass_process_access.yml (94b27935-0ad9-4163-8ae1-8590031958c6)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1003.001 LSASS Memory
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"10") and ((winlog.event_data.TargetImage:"*\\lsass.exe" and (winlog.event_data.GrantedAccess like~ ("0x1010", "0x1410", "0x1438", "0x143a", "0x1fffff"))) and (not (process.executable like~ ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\*", "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\*", "C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\*", "C:\\Program Files\\Windows Defender\\*"))))
